      en: ["Fans often affectionately refer to the stadium as 'Emagumeni'.", "The stadium is owned and operated by the Bulawayo City Council.", "The pitch features a high-quality natural grass playing surface.", "Several key international matches for Zimbabwe have been hosted here.", "The main grandstand underwent a major modernization in the 1990s.", "The official capacity is often capped at 25,000 for high-risk matches."],
      es: ["Inaugurado en 1958.", "Capacidad: 40.000 plazas.", "Altitud: 1.350 metros sobre el nivel del mar.", "Renovación: 2012.", "Club local: Highlanders FC.", "Superficie de juego: césped natural."],
      pt: ["Inaugurado em 1958.", "Capacidade: 40.000 lugares.", "Altitude: 1.350 metros acima do mar.", "Renovação: 2012.", "Clube da casa: Highlanders FC.", "Superfície de jogo: relva natural."],
