      en: ["The church was officially consecrated for worship on April 3, 1904.", "It was granted the status of Minor Basilica on June 21, 2013.", "The building was constructed by Jesuit brothers led by Br. Gillet.", "Pope John Paul II prayed here during his visit to Bulawayo in 1988.", "The structure is built from locally sourced red granite stone.", "It is the first and only Roman Catholic basilica in Zimbabwe."],
      es: ["Construida en 1903.", "Longitud: 35 metros.", "Altura de la torre: 25 metros.", "Elevación a basílica menor: 1954.", "Estilo arquitectónico: neogótico.", "Material: ladrillo y arenisca."],
      pt: ["Construída em 1903.", "Comprimento: 35 metros.", "Altura da torre: 25 metros.", "Elevação a basílica menor: 1954.", "Estilo arquitectónico: neogótico.", "Material: tijolo e arenito."],
      fr: ["Construite en 1903.", "Longueur : 35 mètres.", "Hauteur de la tour : 25 mètres.", "Élévation au rang de basilique mineure : 1954.", "Style architectural : néogothique.", "Matériau : brique et grès."],
