      en: ["The name Karigamombe means 'the one who fells the bull' in Shona.", "The building was completed in the early 1980s, shortly after independence.", "It is located at the corner of Samora Machel Avenue and Leopold Takawira Street.", "The high-rise primarily serves as an office complex for the financial sector.", "It is situated directly opposite the First Street Mall pedestrian area.", "The architecture reflects the late 1970s and early 1980s modern style."],
      es: ["Construido en 1975.", "Plantas: 18.", "Altura: aprox. 80 metros.", "Contiene: Bolsa de Valores de Zimbabue.", "Ubicación: centro de Harare.", "Renovación: 2019."],
      pt: ["Construído em 1975.", "Pisos: 18.", "Altura: cerca de 80 metros.", "Alberga: Bolsa de Valores do Zimbábue.", "Localização: Centro de Harare.", "Renovação: 2019."],
      fr: ["Construit en 1975.", "Étages : 18.", "Hauteur : environ 80 mètres.", "Contient : la bourse du Zimbabwe.", "Localisation : centre d'Harare.", "Rénovation : 2019."],
