      en: ["The tower was completed and inaugurated in 1928.", "It was erected in memory of Major William James Boggie.", "The structure consists primarily of characteristic red bricks.", "It is located exactly in the center of the city of Gweru.", "The tower is approximately 15 meters tall.", "The clock displays the time on four separate faces."],
