      en: ["The building is named after the independence hero Mukwati.", "It is located at the intersection of Livingstone Avenue and Fourth Street.", "Construction began shortly after the attainment of independence in 1980.", "Mukwati houses over ten different government departments.", "It ranks among the top ten tallest buildings in the capital, Harare.", "The architecture is optimized for maximum office space utilization."],
